# ── Claude Code workflow ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Per person, never committed. This is what makes the two-team setup work
# without merge conflicts.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/team

# Review output. Local by choice: reviews in a PR diff cause arguments,
# and two people reviewing one branch would conflict.
.reviews/

# ── Never commit, under any circumstances ─────────────────────────────────
# Content encryption keys, device keystores, master keys.
# The pre-commit hook also blocks these, but belt and braces.
